supRisk.level1_desc:
The occurrence of one of the following circumstances is a particularly significant risk event:
A. has caused or may cause the death of one or more people;
B. may cause direct economic losses of more than 1 million yuan;
C. may cause particularly serious negative impact on the company's reputation and brand image

supRisk.level2_desc:
The occurrence of one of the following situations is a major risk event:
A. Has caused or may cause serious disability to 3 or more people;
B. May cause direct economic loss of the company of 500000 to 1 million yuan;
C. May cause serious negative impact on the company's reputation and brand image.

supRisk.level3_desc:
The occurrence of one of the following situations is a relatively high risk event:
A. One or more persons have been or may be seriously disabled;
B. Direct economic losses of 100000-500000 yuan may be caused to the company;
C. Significant negative impact on the company's reputation and brand image.

supRisk.level4_desc:
The occurrence of one of the following situations is a relatively high risk event:
A. It may cause direct economic losses of less than 100000 yuan;
B. It may have a certain negative impact on the company's reputation and brand image.
